* Netlist provenance snapshot -- sim/README.md convention
* Frozen from design/sg13cmos5l/netlist/divider_chain.spice at commit fbebbdbdd57637b8dae0c1dabaf75d3be5411edb
* (main, after PR #39 -- the SG13CMOS5L device-level layout/LVS series;
*  no schematic content changed since PR #26 ported the blocks).
* Simulated by sim/sg13cmos5l-closed-loop-lock/ (issue #37, Part of #16).
* Independent of whatever design/sg13cmos5l/netlist/divider_chain.spice says today.
