* sg13g2-pll :: divider_chain (SG13CMOS5L) -- generated by design/sg13cmos5l/netlist.sh from divider_chain.sch
* xschem XSCHEM V3.4.7; do not edit by hand.
** sch_path: design/sg13cmos5l/divider_chain.sch
.subckt divider_chain CKIN CKIN_VCO P0 P1 P2 P3 P4 P5 FB DIVOUT VDD_DIV VSS
*.ipin CKIN
*.ipin CKIN_VCO
*.ipin P0
*.ipin P1
*.ipin P2
*.ipin P3
*.ipin P4
*.ipin P5
*.opin FB
*.opin DIVOUT
*.iopin VDD_DIV
*.iopin VSS
XD0 mod0 P0 CKIN ck1 net1 VDD_DIV VSS div23_cell
XD1 mod1 P1 ck1 ck2 mod0 VDD_DIV VSS div23_cell
XD2 mod2 P2 ck2 ck3 mod1 VDD_DIV VSS div23_cell
XD3 mod3 P3 ck3 ck4 mod2 VDD_DIV VSS div23_cell
XD4 mod4 P4 ck4 ck5 mod3 VDD_DIV VSS div23_cell
XD5 VDD_DIV P5 ck5 DIVOUT mod4 VDD_DIV VSS div23_cell
XFRT DIVOUT CKIN_VCO FB VDD_DIV VSS dff_tg_hv
.ends

